# Phase 1 Walkthrough: Core CLI Scaffolding & Global State Persistence

## Summary of Accomplishments
We completed **Phase 1** of **48HFP-Studio**, establishing a terminal-native AI co-pilot CLI for short film festival pre-production.

### Sprint 1.1: Project Scaffolding & CLI Architecture
- Configured project dependencies in [`pyproject.toml`](file:///home/andrew/48HFP%20App/pyproject.toml) and [`requirements.txt`](file:///home/andrew/48HFP%20App/requirements.txt) (`typer`, `rich`, `pydantic`, `pyyaml`, `google-genai`).
